# Excluded from every Docker build context. Keep this tight: anything not on
# the explicit COPY list in a Dockerfile won't enter an image, but a smaller
# context means faster `docker build` and fewer accidental ADD/COPY hits.

# Dependencies — re-installed inside the image
**/node_modules

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/.svelte-kit
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local state
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.DS_Store
*.log

# VCS
.git
.gitignore

# Tooling
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Docs / planning artifacts not needed at runtime
spikes
*.md
!README.md

# Tests aren't shipped to runtime images, but builder stage may still need
# them for `pnpm deploy`; we strip via .gitignore-style patterns at the
# COPY level instead of here.
